From udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com  Fri Apr 29 16:33:56 2016
From: udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com (Perry de Valpine)
Date: Fri, 29 Apr 2016 16:33:56 +0000
Subject: Re: The which function in JAGS. Does such a function exist?
Message-ID: <2fmRfj3OG7A.bmV3lLiRAwAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <2fmRfj3OG7A.Dil3hqJ9AwAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
References: <2fmRfj3OG7A.1XRJZRF2FgAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com> <2fmRfj3OG7A.Dil3hqJ9AwAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
